From 5674c264cc4bf6feca613f379084fe779472589a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:05:06 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: Dialer in the unified style

Colours come from the system's wallpaper tones (the palette files, the theme and accent colours, the in-call background);
the Favorites tab is the newer round-avatar one; favorites and call rows are tonal cards, the call button a round outline,
the selected tab a tinted pill. versionCode 2900001 so it installs as an update while iterating.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WNZzm3UdaCB3bu67ZPQkVe
